","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":68,"last_line":68,"raw_start":5647,"raw_end":5743,"raw_character_offsets":[5649,5650,5651,5652,5653,5654,5655,5656,5657,5658,5659,5660,5661,5662,5663,5664,5665,5666,5667,5668,5669,5670,5671,5672,5673,5674,5675,5676,5677,5678,5679,5680,5681,5682,5683,5684,5685,5686,5687,5688,5689,5690,5691,5692,5693,5694,5695,5696,5697,5698,5699,5700,5701,5702,5703,5704,5705,5706,5707,5708,5709,5710,5711,5712,5713,5714,5715,5716,5717,5718,5719,5720,5721,5722,5723,5724,5725,5726,5727,5728,5729,5730,5731,5732,5733,5734,5735,5736,5737,5738,5739,5740,5741,5742],"revision_id":2012453},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-diaokui:p001:m0001","surface":"逵","start":1,"end":2,"person_id":"sp6_k2v_4kg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-diaokui:p001:m0009","surface":"暢","start":9,"end":10,"person_id":"okk_4oo_lew","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-diaokui:p001:m0017","surface":"弘","start":17,"end":18,"person_id":"vj9_o5b_00i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-diaokui:p001:m0032","surface":"達","start":32,"end":33,"person_id":"sp6_k2v_4kg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-069-diaokui","book_id":"b-jinshu-069","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-069-diaokui-ws2012453"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-diaokui:p002","text":"桓玄篡位，以逵為西中郎將、豫州刺史，鎮曆陽；暢右衛將軍；弘撫軍桓修司馬。劉裕起義，斬桓修，時暢、弘謀起兵襲裕，裕遣劉毅討之，暢伏誅；弘亡，不知所在。逵在曆陽執劉裕參軍諸葛長民，檻車送于桓玄，至當利而玄敗，送人共破檻出長民，遂趣曆陽。逵棄城而走，為下人所執，斬於石頭。子侄無少長皆死，惟小弟騁被宥，為給事中，尋謀反伏誅，刁氏遂滅。刁氏素殷富，奴客縱橫，固吝山澤，為京口之蠹。裕散其資蓄，今百姓稱力而取之，彌日不盡。時天下饑弊，編戶賴之以濟焉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":70,"last_line":70,"raw_start":5745,"raw_end":5967,"raw_character_offsets":[5747,5748,5749,5750,5751,5752,5753,5754,5755,5756,5757,5758,5759,5760,5761,5762,5763,5764,5765,5766,5767,5768,5769,5770,5771,5772,5773,5774,5775,5776,5777,5778,5779,5780,5781,5782,5783,5784,